Important points reflected in this code:

Seat has no SeatStatus.
Lock is based on showId + seatId.
tryLock() is non-blocking.
If one seat fails to lock, all previously acquired locks are released.
Payment uses Strategy + Factory.
BookingService owns the booking flow.
Lock ownership is checked before payment.
Payment failure releases locks.
tryLock() is atomic for a particular seat key using ConcurrentHashMap.compute().
Kept it as a single Java file, suitable for LLD interview practice.